That's all right, thank you for getting back to me about December.

As far as other parks, sometimes it takes them a little while to respond as=
 the volunteer coordinators usually have other duties than just their role =
as the Volunteer Services Lead.  I generally try to respond to everyone who=
 inquires about positions, whether to set up interviews or to let them know=
 the position has been filled, but not everyone may follow that practice.  =
I definitely have had instances where I did not respond to a volunteer inqu=
iry for over a week however, due to being caught up in major park maintenan=
ce or enforcement related duties.

