Hi, Logan.

So I've thought about this, and December doesn't really align with my inten=
tions.

I'll be in the area for September and I was willing to extend that an extra=
 month to come back here, but I'm eager to explore more of the coast, and a=
ccepting a December assignment would require me to stay in the area for man=
y months longer than I intended.

What I really want is to experience Cape Lookout, Fort Stevens, and Beverly=
 Beach. I applied to the positions those parks posted, but no one responded=
 to me, which is what led me to accept the September posting with Franki an=
d exploring any further potential here.

I'm also really interested in Oregon State Forests division - the forest in=
 Tillamook. But I've yet to do my research on this so I haven't reached out=
 to them. And someday maybe the coast will call less to me and I'll be read=
y to explore what else Oregon has to teach me.

I have time. Years, really, to experience all the things I want to. And I a=
m patient - I understand getting myself in the door at some of these parks =
may require a longer record of service.

I appreciate you noting the month was available. As noted previously, I hop=
e to come back February to April to experience another dune season here. I =
will wait to hear form you on that.

Thanks for being such an awesome and understanding boss. I really enjoy wor=
king with you and hope for continued engagement in the years to come - espe=
cially during dune season!

Sam

