<p class=3D"xxmsonormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">Hi Sam,</span><o:=
p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"xxmsonormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">&nbsp;</span><o:p=
></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"xxmsonormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">We will go over t=
he gate coverage this month at the orientation today.&nbsp; I would be fine=
 with having you opening and closing the gates, but I would still like to f=
ind someone to cover your days off so that
 we have the coverage on Wednesdays and Thursdays just in case you needed t=
o leave for your days off and to give you a break on your days off as well.=
&nbsp;
</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"xxmsonormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">&nbsp;</span><o:p=
></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"xxmsonormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">I haven&#8217;t o=
fficially started the 2026 schedule yet, but I have you noted as interested=
 in February, March &amp; April in my calendar.&nbsp; As we get further alo=
ng into February and March, I would be able to officially
 put you on the schedule for 2026 but cannot make any promises yet as we ar=
e just getting started. &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"xxmsonormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">&nbsp;</span><o:p=
></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"xxmsonormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">As for the Octobe=
r position, I have filled it as of this morning.&nbsp; The only month left =
that I would have open will be December of 2025, also at the welcome center=
.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
